1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,390
On a cliff face in Gandaki Province, Gurung honey hunters climb rope ladders to cut combs from the world's largest honey bee, Apis laboriosa.

2
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:17,343
In spring, when the bees feed on laliguras, our national flower, the honey carries a nerve toxin.

3
00:00:17,343 --> 00:00:22,070
People call it mad honey, and it sells for five times the normal price.

